<text xml:space="preserve"  xml:id="gb10779_source_hwit965" corresp="#gb10779_header_hwit965" type="source" rend="authorisedLetter">
  <body>
    <div>
    <pb n="1" facs="gb:digitalisate#10779/13793"/>
      <p>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR103_0_062_008"/>Ich hab ihre <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_001_62_8" xml:id="start_com_0975"/>Rechnungen<ref xml:id="end_com_0975"/> verlegt. Hier sind <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_002_62_8" xml:id="start_com_7405"/>20 Louis dor<ref xml:id="end_com_7405"/>, was <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_003_62_8" xml:id="start_com_0976"/>restirt <ref xml:id="end_com_0976"/>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR103_0_062_009"/>schreiben Sie fürs neue an, <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_004_62_9" xml:id="start_com_0977"/>melden mir’s aber<ptr n="1" target="#a001_62.9"/>
        <ref xml:id="end_com_0977"/>. Dancke dass Sie <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_005_62_9-10" xml:id="start_com_0978"/>Cröngen<ref xml:id="end_com_0978"/>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR103_0_062_010"/>so <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR103_0_note_006_62_10" xml:id="start_com_0979"/>erwischt<ref xml:id="end_com_0979"/> haben, Sie sind ein ganzer Mann. Leben Sie recht 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR103_0_062_011"/>wohl d<g ref="#typoSuspension"/>. 16 May. 76.         G.</p>
    <pb n="2" facs="gb:digitalisate#10779/13794" type="empty"/>
    <pb n="3" facs="gb:digitalisate#10779/13795" type="empty"/>
    <pb n="4" facs="gb:digitalisate#10779/13796" type="empty"/>
